{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:54:11+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:54:11+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Dometic Group AB (publ)","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Leisure","country":"Sweden","city":"Solna","website":"https://www.dometicgroup.com","employees":6863,"summary":"Dometic Group AB (publ) provides mobile living solutions for food and beverage, climate, power and control, and other applications in the United States, Germany, Australia, Italy, France, United Kingdom, Japan, Canada, the Netherlands, Sweden, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Land Vehicles, Marine, Mobile Cooling Solutions, and Global Ventures. The company offers outdoor standalone products, such as portable coolers, drinkware, grills, inflatable tents, and racking and storage systems, as well as customized solutions for land vehicles and boats, including installed kitchen appliances, HVAC, sanitation products, marine steering, and fuel solutions and energy-saving power systems. It also provides products for manufacturers of recreational vehicles (RV OEM), and commercial and passenger vehicles (CPV OEM); service and aftermarket products for the RV and CPV markets; products for boat and engine manufacturers in the marine industry; mobile cooling boxes and drinkware products, as well as mobile power solutions for residential and hospitality businesses. The company's outdoor products sold through retailers or e-commerce. It Electronics sells its products under the Dometic, Balmar, Büttner, Cadac, CDI Electronics, Delta Heat, Enerdrive, Front Runner, Go Power!, NDS, Twin Eagles, Valterra, and Zamp Solar, as well as Igloo, Kampa, Mobicool, Sierra, and Waeco brands. The company was founded in 1922 and is headquartered in Solna, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Dometic Group AB (publ) fournit des solutions de vie mobiles pour la nourriture et les boissons, le climat, l'énergie et le contrôle, et d'autres applications aux États-Unis, en Allemagne, en Australie, en Italie, en France, au Royaume-Uni, au Japon, au Canada, aux Pays-Bas, en Suède et à l'international. Elle opère à travers quatre segments : les véhicules terrestres, la marine, les solutions de refroidissement mobiles et les entreprises mondiales. La société propose des produits autonomes extérieurs, tels que des refroidisseurs portables, des boissons, des grils, des tentes gonflables et des systèmes de rayonnage et de stockage, ainsi que des solutions personnalisées pour les véhicules terrestres et les bateaux, y compris les appareils de cuisine installés, le chauffage, la climatisation, les produits d'assainissement, la direction maritime et les solutions de carburant et les systèmes d'alimentation à économie d'énergie."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":6945929728,"shares_outstanding":319499993,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":5.0440836,"price_to_book":0.36246622,"ev_to_ebitda":6.039,"ev_to_revenue":0.898,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":1.347},"targets":{"current_price":21.74,"mean":35.71429,"median":35.0,"high":55.0,"low":22.0,"n_analysts":7,"reco_mean":1.57143,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-22"],"eps_avg":1.14242,"eps_low":-0.0603,"eps_high":4.4,"revenue_avg":4235774210,"ex_dividend":"2025-04-16","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00741,"institutions_pct":0.70021003,"institutions_float_pct":0.70544,"institutions_n":87,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"HARRIS ASSOCIATES INVESTMENT TRT-Oakmark Intl Small Cap Fd.","pct":0.0224,"shares":7172352,"value":155926930,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0145000005,"shares":4619672,"value":100431668,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0098